# Local-only build/data dirs. Excluded because they are pure upload weight:
# neither is COPYed by the Dockerfile, which rebuilds the frontend in its own
# stage and runs APP_MODE=gcp (Vertex RAG), never the Chroma store in storage/.
# Keep these lines exact — the deploy preflight matches them with `grep -qxF`.
storage
frontend/dist
